<FONT SIZE=2><P>Failure by subcontractors to pay for materials or services could reduce the partnership's profitability&#9;</FONT><A HREF="#_Toc59001135">*</A></P>
<FONT SIZE=2><P>Delay in partnership gas or oil production could reduce the partnership's profitability&#9;</FONT><A HREF="#_Toc59001136">*</A></P></DIR>
