<U><P><A NAME="_Toc42936600"><A NAME="_Toc58911602"><A NAME="_Toc58913564"><A NAME="_Toc59001114">Through their involvement in partnership and other non-partnership activities, the Managing General Partner and its affiliates have interests which conflict with those of the investor partners; actions taken by the Managing General Partner in furtherance of its own interests could result in the partnership's being less profitable and a reduction in cash distributions to the investors</A></A></A></A></P>
