<U><P><A NAME="_Toc42936610"><A NAME="_Toc58911612"><A NAME="_Toc58913574"><A NAME="_Toc59001124">A significant financial loss by the Managing General Partner could result in our inability to indemnify additional general partners for personal losses suffered because of partnership liabilities</A></A></A></A></P>
