<U><P><A NAME="_Toc42936620"><A NAME="_Toc58911622"><A NAME="_Toc58913584"><A NAME="_Toc59001134">A reduced availability of drilling rigs, due in part to intense competition in drilling, may delay the drilling of partnership wells and cash distributions to investors</A></A></A></A></P>
