<U><P><A NAME="_Toc42936621"><A NAME="_Toc58911623"><A NAME="_Toc58913585"><A NAME="_Toc59001135">Failure by subcontractors to pay for materials or services could reduce the partnership's profitability</A></A></A></A></P>
