<U><P><A NAME="_Toc42936626"><A NAME="_Toc58911628"><A NAME="_Toc58913590"><A NAME="_Toc59001140">An investment as an additional general partner in the partnership may not be advisable for a person whose taxable income from all sources is not recurring and is not subject to the higher marginal federal income tax rates</A></A></A></A></P>
