<U><P><A NAME="_Toc42936627"><A NAME="_Toc58911629"><A NAME="_Toc58913591"><A NAME="_Toc59001141">Under the Code, a partner's tax liabilities may exceed the cash distributions received by that partner</A></A></A></A></P>
