<U><P><A NAME="_Toc42936628"><A NAME="_Toc58911630"><A NAME="_Toc58913592"><A NAME="_Toc59001142">If the Service audits the partnership's tax returns, an investor partner might owe more taxes plus interest and penalties</A></A></A></A></P>
