<U><P><A NAME="_Toc42936629"><A NAME="_Toc58911631"><A NAME="_Toc58913593"><A NAME="_Toc59001143">Partnership losses after the conversion of general partnership interests to limited partnership interests will be passive losses for tax purposes</A></A></A></A></P>
