<U><P><A NAME="_Toc42936631"><A NAME="_Toc58911633"><A NAME="_Toc58913595"><A NAME="_Toc59001145">If the Service challenges the partnership's deduction for the prepayment of drilling costs, you could owe additional taxes plus interest and penalties</A></A></A></A></P>
